# @name: openssl | Extract Public Key from Private Key
# @description: Extracts the public key from an RSA private key Group: Key Management. Template: replace placeholders before running. {key_file} = Input private key file [default "key.pem"] | {pubkey_file} = Output public key file [default "pubkey.pem"]
openssl rsa -in {key_file} -pubout -out {pubkey_file}